  ## 201 Created
  
  ```json
  {
    "message": "Event created successfully",
    "event_id": "aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee"
  }
  ```
  
  ## 400 Bad Request
  
  ```json
  {
    "message": "Request is malformed"
  }
  ```
  
  ### 500 Internal Server Error
  
